SUMMARY:Santa in the Village
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate the 10th Annual Santa in the Village! This beloved family tradition is filled with festive holiday fun\, activities for all ages\, and plenty of reasons to make a day of it. Come celebrate the season\, enjoy the festivities\, and experience the magic of the holidays in Bloor West Village! \n🗓️ Saturday\, November 21 | 10 AM – 4 PM📍 Green P Parking Lot (Carpark 91)\, 265 Armadale Ave \n📸 Photos with Santa for a Great Cause! Link To Book Your Time for Santa Photo* \nChoose your preferred time: 10:15am – 12:00pm and 12:15pm – 2:00pm. \nFREE Walk-Ins: (no reservation) from 2:00pm – 4:00pm. \nNote: Each photo reservation will be $10\, with 100% of proceeds going to the Bloor West Food Bank. \n\nHere’s what to expect at the event:\n🔹 Photos with Santa\n🔹 FREE Activities including crafts like decorating a Gingerbread Man\, sponsored by BCU Financial Group! Lego\, Letters to Santa and more…\n🔹 Festive carolers\, Swansea School of Dance Performers\, Kids’ entertainment and costumed characters\n🔹 Ride Sidorova Inwood’s Ho!Ho! Home Express Mini Train. A holiday choo-choo train ride you won’t want to miss!\n🔹 Holiday Marketplace with 20+local artisans and shops\n🔹 Explore Bloor West Village’s local shops\, discover thoughtful gifts\, enjoy festive treats and find plenty of holiday shopping inspiration. \n✨ Gather your family and celebrate the magic of the season with us in the Village. \n \nCheck out the community Craft Fairs at St. Olave’s Church and St. Piux Church in Bloor West Village.
URL:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/event/santa-in-the-village/
LOCATION:Green P Parking Lot (Carpark 91)\, 265 Armadale Ave
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Santa.png
